Subject: [PATCH] feat(studio): add optional web companion under web/studio

Adds a React/TypeScript companion mounted by the FastAPI app at /studio.
The Python engine stays authoritative: the studio posts to /api/check and
displays that verdict, and labels its own browser-side score as a pre-check.

Contents
- pattern library: 526 patterns, 10 categories, 4 levels, seasonal sets
- row counter: per-project ticks, stitch/repeat counters, making time, notes
- importers: in-browser PDF text extraction, SSRF-guarded web import
- pattern canvas: grid editor emitting checker-verified instructions
- courses: 5 progressive courses, 19 lessons
- photo texture aid: ranks stitches by measured fabric texture

Integration
- src/crochet_checker/web/app.py mounts web/studio/dist at /studio only when
  the bundle exists, so the API and the existing UI at / are unchanged
- vite base is configurable via STUDIO_BASE for sub-path builds
- .gitignore re-includes src/client/lib/, which the Python lib/ rule ignored

Verification
- 28 studio tests pass; typecheck and production build clean
- uvicorn run locally: /api/health ok, /studio/ serves, POST /api/check
  returns PASS/ERROR with the expected counts
